s are trying to keep buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Additional Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2D Top-Down Souls-Like</strong>: Experience punishing Souls-Like combat from a new perspective. Nostalgic, gruesomely detailed pixel art in a top-down view with every classic Souls-Like mechanic.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Map &amp; Quest Log</strong>: Track your progress through the twisted, Wild West world of Tombwater with a map and quest log.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gruesome Boss Fights: </strong>Experience 20+ horrifying boss battles that will push you to madness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapons &amp; Spells:</strong> Arm yourself with over 50 weapons, 40 spells, and 40 charms to survive  relentless combat and ghoulish beasts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Apothecary Crafting: </strong>Helpful tonics, explosives and more can be crafted from materials you find while exploring to help aid you in battle\u00a0</p></li></ul>","developers":["Moth Atlas"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308200/header.jpg?t=1760990741","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3308200/581241516/5d407442bc2a840bc360512ef40d1f2b1a0935dd/1760979331/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760985994","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic